      <div class="experiment"><div><span class="section-label">FIRST COMPARISON</span><h3>One frozen model. Three configurations.</h3><p>Fixed persona → reviewed examples → curated case memory.</p></div><div><strong>Measure separately</strong><p>Personality · factual accuracy · authorized completion · false denials · unauthorized proposals · executed effects.</p></div></div>
